[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5644616121","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123398#issuecomment-5644616121","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123398","id":5644616121,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUHIBuQ","user":{"login":"Vaatsal-source","id":229524920,"node_id":"U_kgDODa5FuA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229524920?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaatsal-source","html_url":"https://github.com/Vaatsal-source","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaatsal-source/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaatsal-source/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaatsal-source/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaatsal-source/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaatsal-source/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaatsal-source/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaatsal-source/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaatsal-source/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaatsal-source/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-12T08:02:40Z","updated_at":"2026-09-12T08:02:40Z","body":"Confirmed it, get_playback_position() is hardcoded to return 0, it was never implemented ( it takes no stream ID ), also this class plays multiple sounds at once, each with its own ID, so there's no single position to give at that level.\n\nReproduced on 4.8.dev using the MRP's script, sound played for 46 frames:\n\nFrames tested: 46\nUnique positions: 0.0\n\nThe data isn't missing though each stream already tracks its own position internally. My proposed fix is to add a new method : get_stream_playback_position(stream: int) -> float, matching the existing per-ID pattern (Already used by set_stream_volume, set_stream_pitch_scale, is_stream_playing, and stop_stream on this class.)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5644616121/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]